h behind Emmie\u2019s mysterious discovery. Survive the horrors that await in every shadow, fight your way through creepy entities and brace yourself for a chilling journey that tests the limits of fear and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606\u2605\u00a0<strong><i>GAMEPLAY\u00a0</i></strong>\u2605\u2606</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will work your way through your dreams, piecing together the story as the horrors unravel in front of you. As you reach your limit, Emmie is dragged into her toybox by the entities lurking in the dark, so you jump in after her. You will then platform your way through the twisted toybox world, avoiding traps and using close melee combat to fight, fending off creatures taking on the appearance of toys, all in an effort to get Emmie back from their clutches and hope that everything goes back to normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645670/extras/4f9ca4711d9a06a83a3e5fc3ca0895a6.poster.avif?t=1759446065\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645670/extras/4f9ca4711d9a06a83a3e5fc3ca0895a6.webm?t=1759446065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645670/extras/4f9ca4711d9a06a83a3e5fc3ca0895a6.mp4?t=1759446065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Moonbit"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645670/c8b13e4a690c2ac112de1e2125aff8c8857312da/header.jpg?t=1759446065","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<i>Mr. Hopp's Playhouse </i>franchise is a registered trademark of Moonbit Ltd.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.